details:
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Relationship Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department / Function:&lt;/strong&gt; Commercial &amp;amp; Field Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports To:&lt;/strong&gt; State Coordinator&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Field-based, Nigeria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive base salary + performance-based commission&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Moniepoint&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moniepoint Inc. is Africa’s all-in-one financial platform, helping 20 million businesses and individuals access seamless payments, banking, credit, cross-border, and business management tools each month. As Nigeria’s largest merchant acquirer, we power most of the country’s point-of-sale (POS) transactions and process over $250 billion in digital payment transaction value annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drives business growth by expanding our merchant footprint, building high-value customer relationships, and introducing financial solutions tailored to local business needs. This role is responsible for end-to-end merchant acquisition, terminal deployment, and account retention across assigned commercial areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Identify, visit, and onboard prospective merchants through field engagement, referrals, and local trade community outreach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Educate business owners on Moniepoint’s suite of products, recommending solutions that match their operational and growth goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Achieve and exceed monthly targets for active merchant onboarding, terminal deployment, loan disbursements, and repayments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Oversee end-to-end merchant onboarding, ensuring accurate KYC documentation and strict adherence to operational SOPs and regulatory guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Build and nurture long-term relationships with merchants to encourage account activity, high transaction volume, and ongoing retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Conduct transparent discussions on pricing, terms, and agreements within established company guidelines to build trusted partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Serve as the primary point of contact for customer queries, resolving issues promptly or escalating complex operational needs appropriately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Gather local market intelligence and competitor activity, providing actionable feedback to field leadership to help refine growth tactics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Maintain accurate pipeline records and submit timely field performance reports using CRM tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Bachelor’s degree, Higher National Diploma (HND), or Ordinary National Diploma (OND) from a recognised tertiary institution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ 2 to 4 years of hands-on sales experience, preferably within banking, fintech, payment services, or fast-moving commercial environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Proven track record of meeting or exceeding targets in merchant onboarding, field sales, or client acquisition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Deep understanding of the local financial services landscape and regional trading dynamics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Strong communication and customer relationship skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Practical experience with POS terminal deployment, payment acquiring, or business loan products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Proficiency in CRM software for field tracking, pipeline management, and activity reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ &lt;strong&gt;You build trust easily:&lt;/strong&gt; You connect genuinely with everyday business owners and build lasting community relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ &lt;strong&gt;You are driven by impact:&lt;/strong&gt; You take ownership of your goals and take pride in helping local businesses succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ &lt;strong&gt;You keep things clear and simple:&lt;/strong&gt; You explain complex financial features in straightforward, approachable language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ &lt;strong&gt;You operate with integrity:&lt;/strong&gt; You pursue targets with energy while upholding high standards of compliance and quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ &lt;strong&gt;You are structured and adaptable:&lt;/strong&gt; You organize your daily field schedule efficiently and adapt quickly to market feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ &lt;strong&gt;Target achievement:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistently meeting monthly and quarterly targets for merchant acquisition, terminal deployment, loan disbursements, and transaction volume.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ &lt;strong&gt;Account health &amp;amp; retention:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintaining high activity levels, retention rates, and active usage across onboarded merchant accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ &lt;strong&gt;Quality &amp;amp; compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Achieving high conversion rates through accurate lead qualification and zero compliance exceptions during KYC verification.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ &lt;strong&gt;Merchant satisfaction:&lt;/strong&gt; Establishing long-term relationships that generate organic customer referrals and sustained account growth.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Relationship Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department / Function:&lt;/strong&gt; Commercial &amp;amp; Field Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports To:&lt;/strong&gt; State Coordinator&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Field-based, Nigeria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive base salary + performance-based commission&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Moniepoint&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moniepoint Inc. is Africa’s all-in-one financial platform, helping 20 million businesses and individuals access seamless payments, banking, credit, cross-border, and business management tools each month. As Nigeria’s largest merchant acquirer, we power most of the country’s point-of-sale (POS) transactions and process over $250 billion in digital payment transaction value annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drives business growth by expanding our merchant footprint, building high-value customer relationships, and introducing financial solutions tailored to local business needs. This role is responsible for end-to-end merchant acquisition, terminal deployment, and account retention across assigned commercial areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Identify, visit, and onboard prospective merchants through field engagement, referrals, and local trade community outreach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Educate business owners on Moniepoint’s suite of products, recommending solutions that match their operational and growth goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Achieve and exceed monthly targets for active merchant onboarding, terminal deployment, loan disbursements, and repayments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Oversee end-to-end merchant onboarding, ensuring accurate KYC documentation and strict adherence to operational SOPs and regulatory guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Build and nurture long-term relationships with merchants to encourage account activity, high transaction volume, and ongoing retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Conduct transparent discussions on pricing, terms, and agreements within established company guidelines to build trusted partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;→ Serve as the primary point of contact for customer queries, resolving issues promptly or escalating complex operational needs appropriately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Culture -We put our people first and prioritize the well-being of every team member. We’ve built a company where all opinions carry weight and where all voices are heard. We value and respect each other and always look out for one another. Above all, we are human.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Learning - We have a learning and development-focused environment with an emphasis on knowledge sharing, training, and regular internal technical talks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Compensation - You’ll receive an attractive salary, pension, health insurance, annual bonus, plus other benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect in the hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A preliminary phone call with the recruiter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;An interview with the Hiring Team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;An interview with a member of our Executive team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Moniepoint is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and candidates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moniepoint Inc. is Africa’s all-in-one financial ecosystem, helping 10 million businesses and individuals access seamless payments, banking, credit, and business management tools since 2019. As Nigeria’s largest merchant acquirer, it powers most of the country’s Point of Sale (POS) transactions. Through its subsidiaries, Moniepoint Inc. processes $22 billion monthly for its customers while operating profitably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Copywriter&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Creative team.This role is for you if you’re a strong writer, a curious thinker, and a customer-focused creative who knows how to turn ideas and insights into clear, engaging copy that people understand and act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work across Marketing, Product, Growth, CRM, Social, and Design to create communications for Moniepoint’s products and customers, from campaigns and product launches to CRM, social media content, performance ads, and everything in between, to develop messaging that supports acquisition, engagement, retention, and customer loyalty.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role for someone who can adapt their writing across different channels and audiences while maintaining a consistent Moniepoint voice. You should understand consumer behaviour, enjoy solving communication problems, and know how to make complex information simple and relatable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear, engaging, human-centred copy across Moniepoint’s products and marketing channels, including the app, website, CRM, social media, product experiences, and performance marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop creative concepts and copy for campaigns across OOH, digital, social, TV, radio, CRM, performance, and other channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product, Growth, Design, Motion, Animation, Marketing, CRM, and Social teams to develop and execute campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex financial products, features, and services into simple, relatable messaging that customers can understand and trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write performance marketing copy for platforms including Google, Meta, TikTok, and LinkedIn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a consistent Moniepoint tone of voice across different communications and touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create culturally relevant content that reflects our customers&#39; realities, behaviours, and everyday experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with designers and other creatives to ensure copy and visual execution work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support product launches, seasonal campaigns, partnerships, and customer education initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;3+ years of professional copywriting experience, preferably in an agency, brand, fintech, technology, media, or consumer-facing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating good writing, creative thinking, and experience across different channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing copy for campaigns, product launches, social media, CRM, performance marketing, and digital platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing scripts for motion graphics and animated videos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing performance marketing copy for platforms such as Google, Meta, TikTok, and LinkedIn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with content best practices is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative thinker: &lt;/strong&gt;You can take a brief and find an interesting, relevant way to communicate the message.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer obsessed :&lt;/strong&gt;You think about who you&#39;re speaking to and what matters to them before you start writing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communicator:&lt;/strong&gt;You know how to make complex ideas simple without losing what makes them important.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercially aware :&lt;/strong&gt;You understand that good copy should serve a purpose, whether that&#39;s building awareness, driving action, educating customers, or improving engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insights driven: &lt;/strong&gt;You’re interested in customer behaviour and use research, feedback, and performance data to make your work better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative :&lt;/strong&gt;You work well with designers, marketers, strategists, product teams, and other creatives and are open to feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail oriented: &lt;/strong&gt;You care about the words you put out into the world and take pride in getting the details right.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable :&lt;/strong&gt;You can move between a campaign headline, product script, CRM campaign, &amp;nbsp;or performance marketing copy, without losing the core idea or brand voice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture -We put our people first and prioritize the well-being of every team member. We’ve built a company where all opinions carry weight and where all voices are heard. We value and respect each other and always look out for one another. Above all, we are human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning - We have a learning and development-focused environment with an emphasis on knowledge sharing, training, and regular internal technical talks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation - You’ll receive an attractive salary, pension, health insurance, annual bonus, plus other benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect in the hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A preliminary phone call with a Recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A take home assessment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final interview + Assessment presentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Moniepoint is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and candidates.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moniepoint is an all-in-one financial services platform for emerging markets and the second-fastest growing company in Africa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2019, Moniepoint’s technology has powered over 3 million people, offering personal and business banking, payment, credit and business management tools to help them succeed. Moniepoint processed $182 billion in 2023 and currently processes the majority of the POS transactions in Nigeria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an analytical and execution-driven Credit Risk Analyst to serve as the embedded risk owner within one of Moniepoint’s consumer lending product squads. In this role you will bring together credit policy and portfolio management analytics to ensure every product and feature balances rapid growth with robust credit risk controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will design, monitor, and refine credit policies and decision rules for your squad; oversee portfolio performance and compliance with CBN/MFB and KYC/AML standards; and partner with product, engineering, and operations to build “risk-by-design” products from day one. This role requires a rare mix of analytical depth, regulatory understanding, and product instinct - you will be at the centre of how Moniepoint manages risk at scale within your squad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Curious about what makes Moniepoint an incredible place to work?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://moniepoint.com/blog&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Check out posts on how we cultivate a culture of innovation, teamwork, and growth.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end risk assessment design for new products and features within your squad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain credit policies and decision rules aligned with company risk appetite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Decision Science team to develop credit scorecards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor portfolio quality and produce portfolio performance reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Decision Science to develop credit scoring models and monitor their effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and mitigate operational, fraud, and process risks in collaboration with wider teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide risk-based input on pricing, limits, and product design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain dashboards and analytics for repayment behaviour, cohort trends, and other risk KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the squad’s liaison to central Compliance/Legal and escalate issues promptly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a “risk by design” culture by educating squad members on best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 3 years experience in consumer credit portfolio management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of regulatory requirements (CBN guidelines, AML/CFT, Data Protection, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL Essential, Python (NumPy, Pandas etc.) desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in Credit Risk management (acquisition optimisation, portfolio management etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance commercial goals with risk appetite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator - can translate risk concepts for product/engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good knowledge of financial analysis is an added advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An empathetic, inclusive and curious attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture - We put our people first and prioritise the well-being of every team member. We’ve built a company where all opinions carry weight and where all voices are heard. We value and respect each other and always look out for one another. Above all, we are human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning - We have a learning and development-focused environment with an emphasis on knowledge sharing, training, and regular internal technical talks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation - You’ll receive an attractive salary, plus other benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect in the hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A preliminary phone call with one of our recruiters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A technical interview with the Head of Credit Risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interview with a business lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A behavioural and technical interview with a member of the executive team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moniepoint is an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Moniepoint and Your Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Moniepoint, we are on a mission to create financial happiness for every African, everywhere. From pioneering digital payments to powering millions of businesses across the continent, we build innovative, dependable products that everyday people rely on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the People Team, Talent Acquisition doesn&#39;t just fill open roles; we shape how great talent discovers, joins, and thrives at Moniepoint. You&#39;ll join a collaborative, ambitious team of recruiters, sourcers, and operations specialists who care deeply about candidate experience, equity, and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Early Careers TA Specialist leads the operational delivery of Moniepoint&#39;s structured early-talent ecosystem, spanning university partnerships, campus hackathons, structured internships, and graduate conversions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll partner closely with the Senior TA Strategy &amp;amp; Enablement Manager to turn strategic vision into high-impact, repeatable programmes. You&#39;ll own the day-to-day rhythm of our campus presence and early-career cohorts, ensuring every student, graduate, and intern experiences a transparent, supportive, and inspiring journey into Moniepoint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Campus Engagement &amp;amp; Community Presence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a clear, engaging playbook for how Moniepoint connects with university students and emerging talent through hackathons, tech talks, campus career fairs, and community hubs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the annual early-careers recruiting calendar, aligning outreach windows, assessment cycles, and start dates into a predictable, well-communicated rhythm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and nurture long-term partnerships with universities, student societies, and tech communities across Nigeria to build balanced, diverse talent pipelines year after year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Internship &amp;amp; Graduate Programme Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a structured, end-to-end internship experience—including recruiting, pre-boarding, cohort programming, manager enablement, and conversion into full-time roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with hiring managers and team leads to define project scopes, secure dedicated mentors, and ensure interns work on meaningful, real-world problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage transparent, objective conversion assessments at each stage of the cohort lifecycle using structured, skill-based criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Recruiting Infrastructure &amp;amp; Candidate Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and manage smooth application, screening, and interview workflows for high-volume cohorts within our Applicant Tracking System (ATS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with assessment partners and vendors to deliver fair, accessible, and bias-free evaluation stages for all candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with People Operations, IT, and workplace teams to ensure seamless onboarding and Day 1 readiness for every cohort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide mentorship and day-to-day guidance to junior recruiters or coordinators supporting early-talent pipelines as the function expands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Insights, Reporting &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track key programme metrics, including application conversion rates, cohort diversity, candidate Net Promoter Score (NPS), and post-internship retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather feedback from candidates, interns, and hiring managers to simplify processes and continuously improve programme quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share regular progress updates and data-driven recommendations with the wider TA leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7 years of talent acquisition experience, with proven exposure to campus recruiting, university relations, early-career programmes, or cohort hiring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience coordinating complex projects or multi-stakeholder programmes with strong attention to detail and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using modern Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) and candidate evaluation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to connect authentically with university students and senior stakeholders alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the Nigerian higher education landscape and emerging talent communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or running student hackathons, innovation challenges, or specialized STEM recruitment initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in high-growth technology, fintech, or fast-paced corporate environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with funnel analytics, spreadsheet reporting, or presentation design for leadership reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re an empathetic communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You listen well, build genuine trust with students and hiring managers, and make every candidate feel valued and respected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You bring structure to complex projects:&lt;/strong&gt; You enjoy taking multiple moving parts—dates, venues, mentors, candidate lists—and organizing them into clear, dependable workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re a collaborative problem-solver:&lt;/strong&gt; You approach challenges with curiosity, ask thoughtful questions, and work constructively with hiring managers to find solutions that benefit everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You care deeply about fairness:&lt;/strong&gt; You believe great talent comes from diverse backgrounds, and you actively champion objective, inclusive hiring practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re human and grounded:&lt;/strong&gt; You communicate with clarity, keep things simple, and bring positive energy and humility to your team every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Moniepoint is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and candidates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ranked in 2024 by the Financial Times, Moniepoint is Africa’s fastest-growing fintech, trusted by over &lt;strong&gt;10 million business and individual accounts&lt;/strong&gt;, processing &lt;strong&gt;billions of Naira in transactions monthly&lt;/strong&gt;. Our mission is to enable financial happiness for every African, everywhere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Job Title:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; Field Credit Officer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reports to: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Regional Credit Manager&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Employment Type: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Outsourced&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Mode: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Field Credit Officer, you would be saddled with the duty of onboarding and managing businesses that would access our credit products. You would be tasked with growing your loan portfolio while maintaining profitability by ensuring that all loans are repaid as and when due. As a result, you would play a vital role in the assessment of these businesses during their credit application and leverage innovative tools we have developed to help you monitor their performance during the course of the loan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You would also be responsible for making deductions from several information sources about the 5Cs of credit, with capacity, character, and capital as major priorities. Make recommendations to management before, during, and after the disbursement of a loan facility as to the best actions to be taken, considering several economic factors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and onboard viable businesses within your assigned geographical area to open business accounts with Moniepoint&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Engage customers to ensure optimal usage of accounts to allow them to qualify for access to credit&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Review and approve (or decline) loan requests by thoroughly analyzing all the data available&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Embark on physical visitation to potential borrowers’ business places for evaluation of business books, taking inventory and turnover into consideration&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Meet gross loan portfolio targets and portfolio profit targets by maintaining a healthy number of loan customers while ensuring that all loans in portfolio are performing&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Monitor active loan portfolio to ensure continued use of business account and loan repayment performance&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Perform all other credit-related functions as may be assigned by a supervisor&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Background:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Minimum of an OND in any business-related discipline&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Minimum of 2 years’ experience in a sales role for credit products in a financial institution&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrable knowledge of credit risk analysis&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Good knowledge of financial analysis is an added advantage&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Competencies:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Apt attention to details&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven simple/complex analytical skills&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, presentation and interpersonal skills&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Agility and perseverance&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like in this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Consistent achievement of gross loan portfolio targets and portfolio profit targets.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maintaining a healthy, performing loan portfolio with minimized default rates through rigorous physical visitations and monitoring.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Successful onboarding and engagement of viable businesses that actively utilize Moniepoint business accounts.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Accurate credit risk assessments based on key factors like capacity, character, and capital.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation, benefits, and career growth opportunities.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with Africa’s fastest-growing fintech and make a direct impact on business growth across the region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ranked in 2024 by the Financial Times, Moniepoint is Africa’s fastest-growing fintech, trusted by over &lt;strong&gt;10 million business and individual accounts&lt;/strong&gt;, processing &lt;strong&gt;billions of Naira in transactions monthly&lt;/strong&gt;. Our mission is to enable financial happiness for every African, everywhere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Job Title:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; Field Credit Officer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reports to: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Regional Credit Manager&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Employment Type: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Outsourced&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Mode: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Field Credit Officer, you would be saddled with the duty of onboarding and managing businesses that would access our credit products. You would be tasked with growing your loan portfolio while maintaining profitability by ensuring that all loans are repaid as and when due. As a result, you would play a vital role in the assessment of these businesses during their credit application and leverage innovative tools we have developed to help you monitor their performance during the course of the loan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You would also be responsible for making deductions from several information sources about the 5Cs of credit, with capacity, character, and capital as major priorities. Make recommendations to management before, during, and after the disbursement of a loan facility as to the best actions to be taken, considering several economic factors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
