&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: State Inventory Officer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: State Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type: Outsourced&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Mode: Onsite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The State Inventory Officer is responsible for managing the inventory of POS devices across the region, ensuring accurate tracking, secure storage, and efficient distribution. This role plays a critical part in operational success by validating serial numbers, monitoring stock levels, resolving inventory discrepancies, and collaborating with cross-functional teams to maintain seamless supply chain execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain accurate, up-to-date records of POS devices, including stock levels, locations, and serial numbers; monitor inventory to identify stock shortages and coordinate timely replenishment; conduct regular stock counts and audits to reconcile physical stock with logical inventory.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serial Validation:&lt;/strong&gt; Verify serial number accuracy for all received POS devices against corresponding records, promptly communicate discrepancies to relevant stakeholders, execute corrective actions, and maintain detailed documentation.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discrepancy Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Investigate and resolve discrepancies between physical and logical inventory, implementing corrective measures to prevent future errors and improve overall accuracy.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with procurement, sales, and warehouse teams to optimize inventory operations and communicate inventory status, availability, and concerns effectively with internal stakeholders.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Duties:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform additional operational tasks as delegated and assigned by the State Coordinator.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Background:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;OND/HND or Bachelor’s degree in Supply Chain Management, Logistics, Business Administration, or a related field preferred.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proven, similar experience in inventory management or related operational roles.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Competencies:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong capability to reconcile inventory discrepancies and identify process improvements.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled in using inventory management software and Microsoft Office applications.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail Orientation:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional accuracy in data entry, record-keeping, and serial tracking.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organization &amp;amp; Time Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to prioritize tasks, handle multiple operational demands, and meet deadlines.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Effective written and verbal communication skills across teams.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like in This Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;100% accuracy in POS device serial tracking and inventory records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Zero downtime in distribution caused by unmanaged stock shortages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Rapid, thorough resolution of physical vs. logical inventory discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Seamless alignment and clear communication with sales, procurement, and warehouse teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation, benefits, and career growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Vibrant work culture and support for continuous professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Moniepoint Inc. is Africa’s all-in-one financial platform, helping 20 million businesses and individuals access seamless payments, banking, credit, cross-border, and business management tools each month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As Nigeria’s largest merchant acquirer, we power most of the country’s point-of-sale (POS) transactions. Through our subsidiaries, Moniepoint Inc. processes over $250 billion in digital payment transaction value annually.&lt;/p&gt;
